WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.340
Remember how much thought went into choosing your first mortgage?

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:11.840
You looked at your options, talked it through, and found what felt right for you.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.880
But then life gets busy.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.980
And a few years later, your mortgage is coming up for renewal.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:21.800
It can be tempting just to stay with the lender you know.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.660
Don't just renew. Review.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:34.620
At Mortgage Easy, we can help you review available mortgage options and discuss whether staying with your current lender or moving may be suitable, based on your circumstances.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.900
Because a lot can change in a few years.

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:45.580
We'll take the time to understand what's changed in your life, and check whether the advice you received last time still makes sense today.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:50.620
And sometimes, staying with your existing lender will still be the right choice.

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:52.680
Sometimes it won't.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.100
The important thing is knowing.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:59.020
From today, and in the years ahead, until you're mortgage-free.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:04.480
Mortgage Easy is here from your first home throughout your mortgage journey.

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:10.680
Helping you review your options, make informed choices, and consider what may suit you next.

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:13.460
Don't just renew. Review.
